</element-citation></ref><ref id="REF5"><label>5</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><article-title>Giant Cell Arteritis (Temporal Arteritis)</article-title><person-group>
<name><surname>Ameer</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name>
